gn: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2024/03/21/77124895/283aa29d0f404a1926caaba681ddc006_7417557832540782963.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">燃情热意</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">角色在</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">状态期间造成武器技伤害时，额外造成</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">80.0%/160.0%/240.0%</span><span style=\"color:rgba(38,38,38,1)\">)</span></strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">攻击力的自适应属性伤害，冷却时间5秒</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">炽色狂潮</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">角色释放武器技能时，提高自身造成的全伤害<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">24.0％</span></strong>，持续10秒，可刷新</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">火力全开</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">角色在</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">状态期间入场，回复自身300点生命值，</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;星环爆发&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">状态期间角色处于场上时全伤害提高</span><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">12.0％</span></span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">装备锻造</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1136/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">逆熵·虚数核心</a>x150</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 4;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material 